# Generated glyphs and the demo plan ARE committed (local assets, needed to run
# and to reproduce the screenshots). They live under public/ and are not ignored.

# carta/.gitignore ignores *.png (Carta emits PNG tiles). The viewer's rendered
# screenshots are deliverables, so re-include them here.
!screenshots/
!screenshots/*.png
